          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="b4b7-5338-e8e2-41fd">- When a Ronin model is Killed, Replace it with a Void Rift. This can be used to Deploy a Replacing Void Rift in Base to Base or a ZoC.
- When a Ronin model performs a Scenario Action, remove one fewer Activation Counters at the end of the action.
