          <profiles>
            <profile name="Unique Effects" id="0568-605f-e9fd-00bb" hidden="false" typeId="2f00-4eb0-a8cb-7022" typeName="Unique Effects">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="6de4-d067-c2aa-0dc2">While within 6&quot; of a Friendly Monk, this model gains the Kata trait.


After adding any Void Counters for this model being Killed, until the End Phase of the turn this model was Killed, Void Counters cannot be added to the Communal Card.


If Recruited into a Warband with Master Shi, this model gains Fearless and cannot be affected by Gokusatsu Attack.


Whenever a Friendly Monk would be required to spend or transfer Ki for an effect, you may mark one Wound Box on this model for each Ki Token that would be required to resolve the effect. This may not reduce this model to zero Wounds.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
        </infoGroup>
